@@ -2,4 +2,21 @@
 
 Runs lint, tests, and a scheduled CodeQL analysis.
 
-Actions are referenced by major version tag. There is no Dependabot configuration.
+## Action updates
+
+Every action in `.github/workflows/` is pinned to a full commit SHA with the release
+version in a trailing comment (for example `# v7.0.1`). Tags are mutable, so the SHA is
+what is trusted.
+
+Dependabot (`.github/dependabot.yml`) keeps these pins current:
+
+- It checks the `github-actions` ecosystem weekly.
+- All updates are grouped into a single pull request.
+- A 7-day cooldown delays adoption of brand-new releases, so a malicious release has
+  time to be found and yanked before it is proposed.
+- It rewrites both the SHA and the version comment.
+
+Review each update pull request by reading the upstream diff between the old and new
+SHAs, then merge it; do not leave it open. Do not edit pins by hand or switch back to
+tags; let Dependabot propose changes.
+
